{"channelId":"UC-Blgun7VqHezQ71v-Edvxg","row":["StrayAid Rehoming",41,"Stray Aid is a registered charity, Charity No. 1117372, based in Coxhoe, Durham. Our mission is to rescue, re-unite or rehome the lost, abused, abandoned or unwanted dogs found on the streets in the North East of England. Without your support, we are unable to provide this vital lifeline and we will not succeed in giving these unfortunate dogs a new start in life.  Our aim is to provide practical help and information on stray, lost or abandoned dogs and cats across County Durham, Hartlepool and Middlesbrough. \n\nThis is a very exciting time for the charity. We are raising funds to purchase and redevelop the original boarding kennels site into the new Stray Aid Animal Rescue Shelter. This will complement our existing facilities, allowing us to expand and modernise our kennels. Please help Stray Aid raise £250,000 to purchase our site! Donate now at https://www.justgiving.com/StrayAid-Charity3","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-Blgun7VqHezQ71v-Edvxg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-Blgun7VqHezQ71v-Edvxg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:05.062Z","channelId":"UC-Blgun7VqHezQ71v-Edvxg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"f8d6cacbbbd67a05ebad7f691e452a91f847597cdeeb8d95ae56c4d4fc90e8bb","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"b083229e26d42478ff76e22ec0ba0b3d14dd047491995768ce708e44d691c961"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-Blgun7VqHezQ71v-Edvxg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":41,"raw":"41 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-Blgun7VqHezQ71v-Edvxg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:05.062Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"organizat